  "contentHtml": "<p>생명과학 동아리</p><p>개인탐구 활동으로</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1900년~2024년</p><p>역대 노벨 생리학/의학상(Physiology / Medicine)을 받은</p><p>과학자의 업적을 이해하기 쉽게 정리해서 발표합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f466dd4a4212191535a6bdddf899935746b073b7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f466dd4a4212191535a6bdddf899935746b073b7\" data-origin-width=\"248\" data-origin-height=\"107\"></div><p>&lt;작성 예시&gt;</p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\">1.&#160; 수상연도 : 1953년</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\">2. 수상자 : 제임스 왓슨, 프랜시스 크릭</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\">3. 수상제목 : DNA 이중나선구조 발견</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\">4. 수상업적 : ppt 3장 정도 작성</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\">나의 심화탐구 : “DNA 구조의 발견이 생명과학 발전에 어떤 영향을 주었는가?”</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans KR';\">* 참고 사이트 : 노벨상 공식 홈페이지</span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/lists/all-nobel-prizes/\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/lists/all-nobel-prizes/</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"All Nobel Prizes - NobelPrize.org\" data-og-description=\"Between 1901 and 2024, the Nobel Prizes and the Sveriges Riksbank Prize in Economic Sciences in Memory of Alfred Nobel were awarded 627 times to 1,012 people and organisations. With some receiving the Nobel Prize more than once, this makes a total of 976 i\" data-og-host=\"www.nobelprize.org\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/lists/all-nobel-prizes/\" data-og-url=\"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/lists/all-nobel-prizes/\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/lists/all-nobel-prizes/\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/lists/all-nobel-prizes/\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">All Nobel Prizes - NobelPrize.org</p><p class=\"og-desc\">Between 1901 and 2024, the Nobel Prizes and the Sveriges Riksbank Prize in Economic Sciences in Memory of Alfred Nobel were awarded 627 times to 1,012 people and organisations. With some receiving the Nobel Prize more than once, this makes a total of 976 i</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.nobelprize.org</p></div></a></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/97b2c7cb0d4ce47f2bc52e1d0d22bec01409b11d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/97b2c7cb0d4ce47f2bc52e1d0d22bec01409b11d\" data-origin-width=\"519\" data-origin-height=\"623\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 50%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fa4632ccc4124e7d93ec562334e497f4e12d8bb4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fa4632ccc4124e7d93ec562334e497f4e12d8bb4\" data-origin-width=\"490\" data-origin-height=\"636\"></div></td></tr>